### Health Check API Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost/api
### No authentication required

### Test 1: Health check returns 200 OK
GET http://localhost/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Expected: 200 OK
### Response should include:
### {
###   "status": "UP",
###   "timestamp": "2026-01-30T12:34:56Z"
### }

###

### Test 2: Verify health check responds without database
# Even if database is down, health check should return 200
# This endpoint does NOT require database connection
GET http://localhost/api/health

### Expected: 200 OK with status "UP"

###

### Notes:
### - This endpoint is used to verify backend is running
### - Does NOT check database connectivity
### - Returns current UTC timestamp in ISO 8601 format
